<title>CHINA: Blue Ribbon China's profits up 9.6 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Blue Ribbon China's profits up 9.6 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Blue Ribbon China Group Co reported 330 million yuan ($39.76 million) in pre-tax profits in 1996, up 9.6 percent compared with 1995, the China News Service said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Blue Ribbon, based in southern Guangdong province, produced 230,000 tonnes of beer in 1996, a company official said by telephone.</p>
<p>Total sales reached 1.8 billion yuan last year, up 12.9 percent compared with 1995, the agency said, but gave no other details.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>--Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
